.TH MUNLOCK 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
munlock \- unlocks pages containing the specified range
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mman.h>
.B int munlock(const void* address, size_t byte_count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unlocks pages containing the specified range.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR munlock (2)
